# Frontend config is injected at RUNTIME, not via VITE_* build vars.
#
# In production the nginx image writes /config.js (window.__APP_CONFIG__) from
# the container's OIDC_AUTHORITY / OIDC_CLIENT_ID / API_BASE_URL env (set by
# compose) — see docker-entrypoint.d/40-app-config.sh and src/shared/lib/oidc.ts.
#
# For a plain `pnpm dev` (no config.js), the SPA falls back to
# window.location.origin and client id "chatbotportal-web".
#
# The only build/dev-time flag the SPA still reads from Vite:
VITE_USE_MOCKS=
